&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="card-pad" bgcolor="#F0F0F0" style="background:#F0F0F0;padding:9px 28px 6px;"&gt;
&lt;table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class="meta ipr-d" style="vertical-align:middle;font-family:Teko,'Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:26px;font-weight:400;color:#003A7E;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;"&gt;P. del S. 1632&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="meta meta-date" align="right" style="vertical-align:middle;text-align:right;padding:0 0 3px 12px;font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:15px;font-weight:600;color:#1A1B4D;"&gt;Filed November 11, 2026 · first sent November 12, 2026&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="card-pad" style="padding:22px 28px 24px;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:21px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1B4D;margin:0 0 16px;"&gt;Creates program funding interconnection of existing solar systems and sets deadlines for evaluating applications&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ipr-d" style="font-family:Teko,'Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:20px;font-weight:400;color:#006EB9;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 6px;"&gt;Why it matters:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="body" style="font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:500;color:#1A1B4D;margin:0 0 16px;"&gt;Amends the Net Metering Law to give financial assistance to households and small businesses with solar systems. It sets evaluation deadlines and requires publishing interconnection barriers, affecting energy costs and small-business investment in renewables. The DDEC keyword match is not visible in the text provided.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ipr-d" style="font-family:Teko,'Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:20px;font-weight:400;color:#006EB9;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 6px;"&gt;What's new:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="body" style="font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:500;color:#1A1B4D;font-weight:600;"&gt;First reading in the Senate (Nov 12) → referred to committee (Nov 12).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="padding:0;"&gt;&lt;table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="bar-cell" width="50%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:50%;background:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #1A1B4D;mso-padding-alt:15px 0 15px 4px;"&gt;&lt;a class="cta-a" href="https://sutra.oslpr.org/medidas/162955" style="display:block;padding:15px 0 15px 4px;font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1A1B4D;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;"&gt;View on SUTRA&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="bar-cell" width="50%" bgcolor="#1A1B4D" style="width:50%;background:#1A1B4D;border-top:1px solid #1A1B4D;mso-padding-alt:15px 0 15px 4px;"&gt;&lt;a class="cta-a" href="https://sutra.oslpr.org/SutraFilesGen/162955/ps1632-26.pdf" style="display:block;padding:15px 0 15px 4px;font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFF;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;"&gt;Read the bill (PDF)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
