&lt;td class="meta ipr-d" style="vertical-align:middle;font-family:Teko,'Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:26px;font-weight:400;color:#003A7E;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;"&gt;P. del S. 1529&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="meta meta-date" align="right" style="vertical-align:middle;text-align:right;padding:0 0 3px 12px;font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:15px;font-weight:600;color:#1A1B4D;"&gt;Filed October 15, 2026 · first sent October 16, 2026&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="card-pad" style="padding:22px 28px 24px;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:21px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1B4D;margin:0 0 16px;"&gt;Raises Young Entrepreneurs financing program age limit to 35 at Economic Development Bank&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ipr-d" style="font-family:Teko,'Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:20px;font-weight:400;color:#006EB9;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 6px;"&gt;Why it matters:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="body" style="font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:500;color:#1A1B4D;margin:0 0 16px;"&gt;Widens eligibility for the Economic Development Bank's startup financing program for first-time business owners. The keyword match comes from the bank's name; the measure does not touch incentives or investment promotion.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="ipr-d" style="font-family:Teko,'Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:20px;font-weight:400;color:#006EB9;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 6px;"&gt;What's new:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="body" style="font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:500;color:#1A1B4D;font-weight:600;"&gt;Placed on the Senate special orders calendar (Nov 12) → approved with the committee report's amendments (Nov 12) → approved with floor amendments (Nov 12) → approved by the Senate in final vote (Nov 12) → final approved text sent to the House (Nov 12).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="padding:0;"&gt;&lt;table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="bar-cell" width="50%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:50%;background:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #1A1B4D;mso-padding-alt:15px 0 15px 4px;"&gt;&lt;a class="cta-a" href="https://sutra.oslpr.org/medidas/162596" style="display:block;padding:15px 0 15px 4px;font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1A1B4D;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;"&gt;View on SUTRA&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="bar-cell" width="50%" bgcolor="#1A1B4D" style="width:50%;background:#1A1B4D;border-top:1px solid #1A1B4D;mso-padding-alt:15px 0 15px 4px;"&gt;&lt;a class="cta-a" href="https://sutra.oslpr.org/SutraFilesGen/162596/ps1529%20vot.pdf" style="display:block;padding:15px 0 15px 4px;font-family:Montserrat,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFF;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;"&gt;Read the latest document (PDF)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
